      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a terrible idea.\nBlock is not just for avatars, it's to block the actual person if they are annoying you and you just no longer want to be bothered by them. I've had to block so many creepy people for either harassing me or straight up stalking. There's also crashers as well. I'd hate to see them later in a different world/in the future, so obviously I just block them and forget about it because I have absolutely no desire to ever see these people ever again. \nThe block function should not be touched. If you want to do a \"soft block\" you can already do that. Just hide that persons avatar and mute them. You'll only see them as the grey robot. I do think that maybe if you do \"hide avatar\" that the timer system you suggested would be good to have.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
